e=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">2. 컨설팅 방법</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp; - 상담 내용 : 학습 및 학점 관리, 학습 상담, 자신감 회복</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp; - 소요 시간 : 1시간 내외</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp; - 상담 주기 : 2주 또는 4주(진단 결과에 따라 다름)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp; - 상담 장소 : 교수학습개발센터(벤처창업관 317호)</span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p></span></font><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"돋움\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">3. 신청 안내 </span></span><br></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp; - 신청 기간 : 방학 및 학기 중 상시</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp; - 신청 방법 : 유선(054-478-7352) 또는&nbsp;이메일(<a style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" href=\"mailto:kimjooeun@kumoh.ac.kr\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\">kimjooeun@kumoh.ac.kr</font></u></a>)</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp; - 컨설턴트: 김주은</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span></font></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
